{"id":"c559240b-ced1-4141-b766-93256a04b306","type":"https://serlo.org/editor","variant":"serlo-org","domainOrigin":"serlo.org","version":2,"editorVersion":"0.22.0","dateModified":"2025-02-26T18:20:50.605Z","document":{"plugin":"exercise","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Diese nicht maßstabsgetreue Skizze zeigt einen Würfel mit einer Seitenlänge von "},{"type":"math","src":"4 \text{cm}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"4 cm"}]},{"text":". Die Punkte "},{"type":"math","src":"A","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"A"}]},{"text":" und "},{"type":"math","src":"B","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"B"}]},{"text":" von "},{"type":"math","src":"\triangle\mathrm{ABC}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\triangle\mathrm{ABC}"}]},{"text":" sind die Mittelpunkte der Kanten des Würfels."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Berechne den Winkel "},{"type":"math","src":"\alpha","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\alpha"}]},{"text":"."}]}],"id":"4049e2b0-2bab-40c8-8d68-68f4e8b69a93"},{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"https://assets.serlo.org/legacy/5937c97996962_162f72c8d656c8b407c2944c94ca133c7db49b1c.png","alt":"","caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{}]}],"id":"cc135d00-8c6f-48f4-b415-aba9faee16fc"}},"id":"af9b735e-7e31-45c2-bacf-f19ad2c0d2b2"}],"id":"83437f87-4907-4ead-8a83-3e6990c346c7"},"solution":{"plugin":"solution","state":{"prerequisite":{"id":"1515","title":"Satz des Pythagoras"},"strategy":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{}]}],"id":"80b59c7c-4968-4e39-88a6-a5a345799630"},"steps":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Zunächst denkst du dir ein rechtwinkliges Dreieck, indem du von Punkt A nach oben an die Ecke des Würfels gehst. Die Strecke von "},{"type":"math","src":"A","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"A"}]},{"text":" zur oberen Ecke hat eine Länge von "},{"type":"math","src":"\dfrac{a}{2} = \dfrac{4\text{cm}}{2} = 2\text{cm}.","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\dfrac{a}{2}"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Nun denkst du dir eine Diagonale von dieser Ecke des Würfels hinüber zu Punkt "},{"type":"math","src":"C","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"C"}]},{"text":". Die Länge "},{"type":"math","src":"d","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"d"}]},{"text":" dieser Diagonale lässt sich mit dem "},{"type":"a","href":"/1515","children":[{"text":"Satz des Pythagoras"}]},{"text":"  berechnen: "},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}
\sqrt{a^2 + a^2} &=& d \\
\sqrt{(4\text{cm})^2 + (4\text{cm})^2} &=& d \\
\sqrt{32\text{cm}^2} &=& d \\
d &=& \sqrt{32}\text{cm} \approx 5,66\text{cm}
\end{array}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\sqrt{a^2 + a^2} = d"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Nun kannst du die Länge der Strecke "},{"type":"math","src":"\overline{AC}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"AC"}]},{"text":" berechnen:"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}
\overline{AC} &=&\sqrt{\left(\frac a2\right)^2+d^2}\\
\overline{AC} &=& \sqrt{\left(\frac{4cm}{2}\right)^2+(\sqrt{32}cm)^2}\\
\overline{AC} &=& 6cm
\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":"\begin{array}{l}AC=\sqrt{\left(\frac a2\right)^2+d}²\\AC=\sqrt{\left(\frac{4cm}2\right)^2+(5,66cm)}²\\AC=6cm\end{array}"}]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Um den Winkel zu berechnen, benötigst du eine zweite Seite des eingezeichneten Dreiecks. Nämlich die der Strecke "},{"type":"math","src":"\overline{AB}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"AB"}]},{"text":"."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}
\overline{AB} &=& \sqrt[{}]{\left(\frac a2\right)^2+\left(\frac a2\right)^2}\\
\overline{AB} &=& \sqrt[{}]{\left(\frac{4cm}2\right)^2+\left(\frac{4cm}2\right)^2}\\
\overline{AB} &=& \sqrt{8}\text{cm} &\approx & 2,83\text{cm}
\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":"\begin{array}{l}\begin{array}{l}AB=\;\sqrt[{}]{\left(\frac a2\right)^2+\left(\frac a2\right)^2}\\AB=\;\sqrt[{}]{\left(\frac{4cm}2\right)^2+\left(\frac{4cm}2\right)^2}\end{array}\\AB=\;2,83cm\end{array}"}]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Wenn du nun im Dreieck "},{"type":"math","src":"\triangle ABC","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\triangle ABC"}]},{"text":" die Höhe einzeichnest (wobei die Strecke "},{"type":"math","src":"[AB]","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"[AB]"}]},{"text":" die Grundseite darstellt), erhältst du zwei rechtwinklige Dreiecke. Du betrachtest das obere. In diesem kennst du die Länge der Gegenkathete ("},{"type":"math","src":"\dfrac{\sqrt{8}}{2}\text{cm} = \sqrt{2}\text{cm}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\frac{\sqrt{8}\text{cm}}{2}"}]},{"text":") von "},{"type":"math","src":"\dfrac{\alpha}{2}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\frac{\alpha}{2}"}]},{"text":" und die Länge der Hypothenuse ("},{"type":"math","src":"6\text{cm}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"6\text{cm}"}]},{"text":"). Mit diesen beiden Seiten bist du nun in der Lage, den Winkel auszurechnen. Dafür benutzt du den Sinus: "},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}
\sin(\dfrac{\alpha}{2}) &=& \dfrac{\sqrt{2}\text{cm}}{6\text{cm}} \\\\
\dfrac{\alpha}{2} &=& \sin^{-1}(\frac{\sqrt{2}}{6})\\\\
\alpha &=& 2\cdot\sin^{-1}(\frac{\sqrt{2}}{6}) &\approx& 27,27 °
\end{array}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"7ae540ce-b26b-42e1-adff-0bb00b843dcb"}],"id":"7798cc3a-7ad6-4d50-a48c-9a71ceea6b06"}},"id":"d8571239-180e-40d3-891d-6c184bf1a105"}},"id":"c013689b-1067-4295-9cf4-214c6968c7ad"}}
